{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BdGM9zc9mN5ghKSWhauSep","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the context. Let me write the full paper. I need to:\n\n1. Cover all 12 experiments with corresponding sections/tables\n2. Follow narrative guidance: conditional detection claims, inverted-U with boundary conditions, smaller audit, Gemini as converging evidence, power-information tradeoff as contribution\n3. Use real numbers from experiment_data.json\n4. Write in proper academic style\n\nLet me structure:\n\n- Abstract\n- 1. Introduction\n- 2. Background (IRT, person-fit, contamination detection)\n- 3. Method (IRT-FIT framework)\n\n\n- 4. Simulation Studies (Exp 1 + Exp 4 + Exp 11)\n- 5. Controlled Contamination Experiments (Exp 2 + Exp 3)\n- 6. Analysis (Exp 7: 4PL ablation, Exp 8: baselines, Exp 9: lzm, Exp 10: post-RL)\n- 7. Leaderboard Audit (Exp 5 + Exp 6 + Exp 12)\n- 8. Discussion and Conclusion\n\nNow I'm writing the LaTeX document, being careful about proper formatting, citation style, and ensuring all numerical results are accurately pulled from the data.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3307,"cache_read_input_tokens":48845,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3307},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c560ffc4-2553-43eb-aa7c-f1dd9d3f15d6","uuid":"a95f9eac-a3d8-438e-9102-d729848955f8"}
